---
// v2/src/components/pace/Faq.astro
---

<section id="faq" class="py-24 sm:py-36 bg-[#f6f7f9] border-t border-[#e2e5eb]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px] px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <span class="eyebrow block mb-3 text-[#ff5a1f]">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl text-[#0c0e12] leading-[0.92]">
        Good to know.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Accordion List -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <!-- Item 1 -->
      <details class="faq-item group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e5eb] p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all open:shadow-md">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-display text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#0c0e12]">
          <span>How does PACE charge without removing it from my wrist?</span>
          <span class="size-8 rounded-full bg-[#f6f7f9] flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4 font-normal">
            +
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[#5e6777] leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base border-t border-[#e2e5eb]/60 pt-4">
          PACE comes with a compact, curved wireless power pack that slides directly over the titanium core while you continue working, sleeping, or training. A 45-minute charge provides 7 full days of uninterrupted recording.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- Item 2 -->
      <details class="faq-item group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e5eb] p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all open:shadow-md">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-display text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#0c0e12]">
          <span>Is there really no recurring subscription?</span>
          <span class="size-8 rounded-full bg-[#f6f7f9] flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4 font-normal">
            +
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[#5e6777] leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base border-t border-[#e2e5eb]/60 pt-4">
          None. We believe your physiological data belongs to you. Every biomarker, sleep staging metric, cardiovascular trend, and exportable raw log is unlocked permanently upon purchasing the $299 band.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- Item 3 -->
      <details class="faq-item group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e5eb] p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all open:shadow-md">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-display text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#0c0e12]">
          <span>Can I swim in open ocean water or chlorinated pools?</span>
          <span class="size-8 rounded-full bg-[#f6f7f9] flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4 font-normal">
            +
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[#5e6777] leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base border-t border-[#e2e5eb]/60 pt-4">
          Yes. The Grade 5 titanium housing is rated 10 ATM (100 meters waterproof). The technical polyamide weave resists salt buildup and dries in roughly 20 minutes after emerging from the water.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- Item 4 -->
      <details class="faq-item group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e5eb] p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all open:shadow-md">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-display text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#0c0e12]">
          <span>How does PACE integrate with Apple Health and Strava?</span>
          <span class="size-8 rounded-full bg-[#f6f7f9] flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 shrink-0 ml-4 font-normal">
            +
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[#5e6777] leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base border-t border-[#e2e5eb]/60 pt-4">
          The companion iOS and Android app seamlessly exports resting heart rate, active calories, sleep stages, and VO2 Max into Apple Health and Google Health Connect, while syncing structured workouts directly to Strava.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
